ODE8101 [*] The author key in the manifest file must be a string (with comma separated values)
 --> __manifest__.py:3:5
  |
1 | {
2 |     "name": "My Module",
3 |     "author": ["Someone"],
  |     ^^^^^^^^
4 | }
  |
help: Join the authors into one string
  |
2 |     "name": "My Module",
  -     "author": ["Someone"],
3 +     "author": "Someone",
4 | }
  |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior

